        "name": "USN-8233-2",
        "description": "USN-8233-1 fixed a vulnerability in nghttp2. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   Andrew MacPherson discovered that nghttp2 did not properly validate  internal state when the session termination API was called. A remote  attacker could possibly use this issue to cause nghttp2 to crash,  resulting in a denial of service.",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-27135"
        ]
      },
